### Project Architecture

This project follows a structured data engineering architecture to transform SAP financial data into meaningful business insights.

Data is extracted from SAP source tables and processed using Azure Databricks. The data moves through the Bronze, Silver, and Gold layers following the Medallion Architecture.

- **Bronze Layer:** Stores raw SAP financial data.
- **Silver Layer:** Performs data cleaning, transformation, validation, and data integration.
- **Gold Layer:** Contains business-ready fact and dimension tables for financial analysis.
- **Power BI:** Connects to the Gold layer to create interactive dashboards and visualizations.

The final dashboards provide insights into Management P&L, Cost Center Performance, Capex Analysis, and Journal Analysis.
